{"id":208,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"言語技術で学力を積む履正社中高","feature_description":"履正社中学校・高等学校は、日本で唯一の六年一貫『言語技術教育』を打ち出し、学藝コースを中心に学力を段階的に積み上げる方針を示しています。学校生活の案内でも、学習と行事、クラブ活動を両立させる設計が見て取れます。3ヵ年独立コースの存在も公式に案内され、進路の選択肢が明確です。言語を使って思考と表現を鍛える教育が核です。日々の発信を重ねる学校です。","clubs":[{"id":4618,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4619,"name":"男女バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4620,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4621,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4622,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4623,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4624,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4625,"name":"空手部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4626,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4627,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4628,"name":"読書部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4629,"name":"かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://riseisha.ed.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":817,"attribute_key":"uniform_policy","source_url":"https://www.nichinoken.co.jp/np5/sc